  "sections": [
    {
      "selector": "div",
      "type": "hero",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 65,
      "width": 1920,
      "height": 994,
      "heading": "AI, Made Simple.",
      "backgroundColor": "#FFFFFF",
      "callsToAction": [
        "Let Us Bring AI to Your Field",
        "Explore Our Products",
        "About Swaibian"
      ],
      "text": "SWAIBIAN SWAIBIAN SWAIBIAN SWAIBIAN SWAIBIAN SWAIBIAN AI, Made Simple. Swabian Heritage. Silicon Valley Innovation. Rooted in the heart of Swabia — where precision engineering meets relentless innovation. We bring world-class AI solutions to companies and users, making complex technology effortlessly simple. “From Stuttgart to the world — Swabian quality, now powered by artificial intelligence.” OIL & GAS GASTRONOMY MULTIMEDIA LET US BRING AI TO YOUR FIELD Explore Our Products About Swaibian",
      "layout": "centered",
      "assetUrls": []
    },
    {
      "selector": "#products",
      "type": "content",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 1059,
      "width": 1920,
      "height": 4396,
      "heading": "FRAMEWORKS",
      "backgroundColor": "#FFFFFF",
      "callsToAction": [
        "Read the story",
        "See Plaza"
      ],
      "text": "FRAMEWORKS BrainWavr Agent-assisted workspaces for versioned projects, exports, and domain views — built on Swaibian's ScaiCo technology. Workflow navigation, progress, and collaboration in one surface Open a project and move through the workflow tree, track progress, manage collaborators, and access history, export, chat, and actions — all from one authenticated workspace. “One workspace for project flow, AI actions, version history, and export — structured for agents, built for teams.” BrainWavr Agent-assisted workflow platform Read the story ScaiCo Scaled agentic Company — shape blueprints,",
      "layout": "grid",
      "assetUrls": [
        "https://www.swaibian.com/_next/image?url=%2Fproducts%2Fbrainwavr%2Fstoryboard-project.png&w=1080&q=75",
        "https://www.swaibian.com/_next/image?url=%2Fproducts%2Fscaico%2Fscaico-studio-overview.png&w=1080&q=75",
        "https://www.swaibian.com/_next/image?url=%2Fproducts%2Fplaza-globetrotter%2Fgenerated%2Fglobetrotter-away-from-desk-relay-scene.jpg&w=1080&q=75",
        "https://www.swaibian.com/_next/image?url=%2Fproducts%2Fbookbloom%2Fgenerated%2Fbb-feature-characters.jpg&w=1080&q=75",
        "https://www.swaibian.com/_next/image?url=%2Fproducts%2Fnotaria%2Fgenerated%2Fnotaria-crystalline-trust.jpg&w=1080&q=75",
        "https://www.swaibian.com/_next/image?url=%2Fproducts%2Ftendr%2Fgenerated%2Ftendr-hero.jpg&w=1080&q=75"
      ]
    },
    {
      "selector": "#scaico",
      "type": "content",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 1853,
      "width": 1920,
      "height": 738,
      "heading": "ScaiCo",
      "backgroundColor": "#FFFFFF",
      "callsToAction": [
        "Read the story"
      ],
      "text": "ScaiCo Scaled agentic Company — shape blueprints, attach tools, run live sessions, and keep budgets visible as work moves. Create agents and teams without writing code Start from a guided studio: create projects, specialist agents, teams, and tool access. Shape the structure before anything runs — no orchestration plumbing needed. “Build the team structure once, export it as a blueprint, and redeploy it across projects — no re-configuration, no re-coding.” ScaiCo Multi-agent orchestration platform Read the story",
      "layout": "split",
      "assetUrls": [
        "https://www.swaibian.com/_next/image?url=%2Fproducts%2Fscaico%2Fscaico-studio-overview.png&w=1080&q=75"
      ]
    },
    {
      "selector": "#plaza",
      "type": "content",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 2647,
      "width": 1920,
      "height": 594,
      "heading": "Talk to your assistant from your phone or watch.",
      "backgroundColor": "#FFFFFF",
      "callsToAction": [
        "See Plaza"
      ],
      "text": "PLAZA FLAGSHIP GLOBETROTTER COMPANION Talk to your assistant from your phone or watch. Catch the thought now. Let Plaza carry it forward. Send a thought, task, or quick instruction while you are away from the desk, then return to the full workspace when the work is ready for you. PHONE WATCH ASSISTANT ON THE MOVE See Plaza",
      "layout": "split",
      "assetUrls": [
        "https://www.swaibian.com/_next/image?url=%2Fproducts%2Fplaza-globetrotter%2Fgenerated%2Fglobetrotter-away-from-desk-relay-scene.jpg&w=1080&q=75"
      ]
    },
    {
      "selector": "#bookbloom",
      "type": "content",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 3241,
      "width": 1920,
      "height": 738,
      "heading": "BookBloom",
      "backgroundColor": "#FFFFFF",
      "callsToAction": [
        "Read the story"
      ],
      "text": "BookBloom Literature that talks back — AI characters, scene generation, and immersive audio built into the reading experience via the ERES format. Talk to the characters while you read Open the character panel inside the reading view and ask questions in context. The cast responds with knowledge grounded in the text — not the internet. Conversations happen inside the story world. “Characters that know their own story, scenes that paint themselves, and a soundtrack that breathes with every chapter.” BookBloom Interactive reading platform Read the story",
      "layout": "split",
      "assetUrls": [
        "https://www.swaibian.com/_next/image?url=%2Fproducts%2Fbookbloom%2Fgenerated%2Fbb-feature-characters.jpg&w=1080&q=75"
      ]
    },
    {
      "selector": "#notaria",
      "type": "content",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 3979,
      "width": 1920,
      "height": 738,
      "heading": "Notaria",
      "backgroundColor": "#FFFFFF",
      "callsToAction": [
        "Read the story"
      ],
      "text": "Notaria Blockchain-secured digital notarization with AI-powered notary and lawyer agents — built on Swaibian's ScaiCo technology. Verify a document without signing in Paste a hash or upload a file to compute it in the browser, then check notarization status — no account needed. Start with verification, go deeper when you're ready. “No scheduling, no office visits. Your AI notary and legal team are always at hand — open verification for anyone, deeper workflow when you sign in.” Notaria Digital notarization platform Read the story",
      "layout": "split",
      "assetUrls": [
        "https://www.swaibian.com/_next/image?url=%2Fproducts%2Fnotaria%2Fgenerated%2Fnotaria-crystalline-trust.jpg&w=1080&q=75"
      ]
    },
    {
      "selector": "#tendr",
      "type": "content",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 4717,
      "width": 1920,
      "height": 738,
      "heading": "Tendr",
      "backgroundColor": "#FFFFFF",
      "callsToAction": [
        "Read the story"
      ],
      "text": "Tendr Guests scan a QR code, chat with AI, and discover every dish — allergens, pairings, and translations included. Upload a photo, get a digital menu in seconds Photograph a printed menu and receive structured, searchable dish data within seconds — prices, descriptions, and allergens included. No manual entry, no delays. Tendr AI-powered menu assistant Read the story",
      "layout": "split",
      "assetUrls": [
        "https://www.swaibian.com/_next/image?url=%2Fproducts%2Ftendr%2Fgenerated%2Ftendr-hero.jpg&w=1080&q=75"
      ]
    },
